nue cooking until fully tender, following the packet if it requires longer. Never cook raw kidney beans only in a slow cooker. The dry weight, not the hydrated weight, is the calorie reference.", "es": "Pesa en seco y remoja al menos 12 horas. Desecha el agua de remojo, enjuaga y usa abundante agua nueva. Hierve enérgicamente al menos 10 minutos y continúa la cocción hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase si exige más tiempo. Nunca cocines alubias rojas crudas solo en una olla de cocción lenta. La referencia calórica es el peso seco, no el hidratado."}}, {"ingredient_id": "rice_brown", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_grain", "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then cook with water according to the packet until tender; rinse quinoa first. Drain only if the packet method requires it. Count the original dry quantity for calories. Serve rice promptly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es": "Pesa en seco y cocina con agua según el envase hasta que esté tierno; lava antes la quinoa. Escurre solo si el método del envase lo requiere. Usa la cantidad seca inicial para calcular las calorías. Sirve el arroz enseguida; enfría las sobras rápidamente, idealmente en una hora, refrigera, consume en 24 horas y recalienta una sola vez."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare", "rice_storage"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m02','{"id": "m02", "name": {"en": "Ginger red-lentil dal", "es": "Dal de lentejas rojas y jengibre"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 30, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Ginger red-lentil dal", "es": "Dal de lentejas rojas y jengibre"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "lentils_red", "quantity": 70, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "tomato_canned", "quantity": 120, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "onion", "quantity": 60, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "ginger", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "garlic", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "coconut_milk", "quantity": 40, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "coriander", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Rinse the dry lentils. Soften onion, garlic and ginger in the measured oil.", "es": "Enjuaga las lentejas secas. Rehoga la cebolla, el ajo y el jengibre con el aceite medido."}, {"en": "Add lentils, tomatoes and enough water to cover generously. Simmer 20–25 minutes until the lentils are tender; stir in coconut milk and coriander.", "es": "Añade las lentejas, el tomate y suficiente agua para cubrir holgadamente. Cuece 20–25 minutos hasta que estén tiernas; incorpora la leche de coco y el cilantro."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 361.75, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "361.75", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["lentil"]}, {"id": "side", "kind": "side", "name": {"en": "Grain accompaniment", "es": "Guarnición de cereal"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "rice_white", "quantity": 50, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the weighed dry grain using its preparation instructions; serve with the main dish.", "es": "Cocina el cereal pesado en seco siguiendo sus instrucciones de preparación y sírvelo con el plato principal."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 175.5, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "175.5", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["rice"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Orange and almonds", "es": "Naranja con almendras"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "orange", "quantity": 150, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "almond", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Peel the orange, weigh its flesh and serve with the measured almonds.", "es": "Pela la naranja, pesa la pulpa y sirve con las almendras medidas."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 109.4, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "109.4", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 537.25, "with_optional_dessert": 646.65}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "537.25", "with_optional_dessert": "646.65"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "lentils_red", "mode": "within_main_method", "kind": "dry_lentil", "soak_minutes": 0, "additional_cook_minutes_range": [20, 40], "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry and rinse. Cook in plenty of water until fully tender, following the packet; red split lentils usually soften sooner than whole lentils. No cooked-weight conversion is assumed.", "es": "Pesa en seco y enjuaga. Cuece en abundante agua hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase; las lentejas rojas partidas suelen ablandarse antes que las enteras. No se presupone ninguna conversión de peso cocido."}}, {"ingredient_id": "rice_white", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_grain", "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then cook with water according to the packet until tender; rinse quinoa first. Drain only if the packet method requires it. Count the original dry quantity for calories. Serve rice promptly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es": "Pesa en seco y cocina con agua según el envase hasta que esté tierno; lava antes la quinoa. Escurre solo si el método del envase lo requiere. Usa la cantidad seca inicial para calcular las calorías. Sirve el arroz enseguida; enfría las sobras rápidamente, idealmente en una hora, refrigera, consume en 24 horas y recalienta una sola vez."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "coconut_milk", "for_patterns": ["vegan"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "coconut_milk", "for_patterns": ["vegan"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare", "rice_storage"]}'::jsonb);
