ly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es": "Pesa en seco y cocina con agua según el envase hasta que esté tierno; lava antes la quinoa. Escurre solo si el método del envase lo requiere. Usa la cantidad seca inicial para calcular las calorías. Sirve el arroz enseguida; enfría las sobras rápidamente, idealmente en una hora, refrigera, consume en 24 horas y recalienta una sola vez."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare", "cook_thoroughly", "rice_storage"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m30','{"id": "m30", "name": {"en": "Cod, potato and pea tray bake", "es": "Bandeja de bacalao, patata y guisantes"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 40, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Cod, potato and pea tray bake", "es": "Bandeja de bacalao, patata y guisantes"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "cod", "quantity": 170, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "potato", "quantity": 220, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}, {"ingredient_id": "peas", "quantity": 140, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "lemon_juice", "quantity": 15, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "garlic", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "parsley", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cut potato into small cubes, toss with measured oil and roast at 200°C until nearly tender.", "es": "Corta la patata en dados pequeños, mezcla con el aceite medido y asa a 200 °C hasta que esté casi tierna."}, {"en": "Add cod with garlic and lemon, and frozen peas with a little water. Cover and continue until fish reaches a safe core temperature and peas are cooked; add parsley.", "es": "Añade el bacalao con ajo y limón y los guisantes congelados con un poco de agua. Tapa y continúa hasta que el pescado alcance una temperatura interior segura y los guisantes estén hechos; añade perejil."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 453.06, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "453.06", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian"], "variety_keys": ["cod", "potato"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Melon and mint", "es": "Melón con menta"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "melon", "quantity": 180, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "mint", "quantity": 2, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Remove peel and seeds, weigh the melon flesh and serve with washed mint.", "es": "Retira la piel y las semillas, pesa la pulpa del melón y sirve con menta lavada."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 44.06, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "44.06", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 453.06, "with_optional_dessert": 497.12}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "453.06", "with_optional_dessert": "497.12"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": []}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare", "cook_thoroughly"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m31','{"id": "m31", "name": {"en": "Roasted cauliflower and lentil salad", "es": "Ensalada de coliflor asada y lentejas"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 35, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Roasted cauliflower and lentil salad", "es": "Ensalada de coliflor asada y lentejas"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "cauliflower", "quantity": 250, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "lentils_green", "quantity": 60, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}, {"ingredient_id": "carrot", "quantity": 80, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "lemon_juice", "quantity": 15, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "parsley", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "pumpkin_seed", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the weighed dry lentils. Cut cauliflower and carrot, toss with measured oil and roast at 200°C until tender and lightly coloured.", "es": "Cuece las lentejas pesadas en seco. Corta la coliflor y la zanahoria, mezcla con el aceite medido y asa a 200 °C hasta que estén tiernas y ligeramente doradas."}, {"en": "Toss with cooked lentils, lemon, parsley and pumpkin seeds; serve warm.", "es": "Mezcla con las lentejas cocidas, el limón, el perejil y las pipas de calabaza; sirve templado."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 383.92, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "383.92", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["cauliflower", "lentil"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Grapes and walnuts", "es": "Uvas con nueces"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "grapes", "quantity": 120, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "walnut", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Wash and weigh the edible grapes and serve with the measured walnut kernels.", "es": "Lava y pesa la parte comestible de las uvas y sirve con las nueces medidas."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 146.8, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "146.8", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 383.92, "with_optional_dessert": 530.72}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "383.92", "with_optional_dessert": "530.72"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "lentils_green", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_lentil", "soak_minutes": 0, "additional_cook_minutes_range": [20, 40], "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry and rinse. Cook in plenty of water until fully tender, following the packet; red split lentils usually soften sooner than whole lentils. No cooked-weight conversion is assumed.", "es": "Pesa en seco y enjuaga. Cuece en abundante agua hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase; las lentejas rojas partidas suelen ablandarse antes que las enteras. No se presupone ninguna conversión de peso cocido."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": []}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m32','{"id": "m32", "name": {"en": "Broccoli and sesame tofu quinoa", "es": "Quinoa con brócoli, tofu y sésamo"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 20, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Broccoli and sesame tofu quinoa", "es": "Quinoa con brócoli, tofu y sésamo"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "tofu", "quantity": 200, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "broccoli", "quantity": 180, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "ginger", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "soy_sauce", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "sesame", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the quinoa and steam broccoli until tender. Warm measured oil and ginger in a pan.", "es": "Cuece la quinoa y cocina el brócoli al vapor hasta que esté tierno. Calienta el aceite medido y el jengibre en una sartén."}, {"en": "Add the source-matching plain steamed tofu gently, broccoli and soy sauce. Heat through, then serve with quinoa and sesame.", "es": "Añade con cuidado el tofu natural al vapor que corresponda a la referencia, el brócoli y la salsa de soja. Calienta bien y sirve con quinoa y sésamo."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 322.05, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "322.05", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["tofu"]}, {"id": "side", "kind": "side", "name": {"en": "Grain accompaniment", "es": "Guarnición de cereal"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "quinoa", "quantity": 60, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the weighed dry grain using its preparation instructions; serve with the main dish.", "es": "Cocina el cereal pesado en seco siguiendo sus instrucciones de preparación y sírvelo con el plato principal."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 185.4, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "185.4", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["quinoa"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Kiwi and orange", "es": "Kiwi y naranja"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "kiwi", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "orange", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Peel both fruits, weigh the edible flesh, chop and combine.", "es": "Pela ambas frutas, pesa la parte comestible, corta y mezcla."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 80.0, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "8E+1", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 507.45, "with_optional_dessert": 587.45}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "507.45", "with_optional_dessert": "587.45"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "quinoa", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_grain", "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then cook with water according to the packet until tender; rinse quinoa first. Drain only if the packet method requires it. Count the original dry quantity for calories. Serve rice promptly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es