rtify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m33','{"id": "m33", "name": {"en": "Black-eyed beans with sweet potato", "es": "Alubias carillas con boniato"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 30, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Black-eyed beans with sweet potato", "es": "Alubias carillas con boniato"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "beans_blackeye", "quantity": 70, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "sweet_potato", "quantity": 200, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}, {"ingredient_id": "tomato_canned", "quantity": 160, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "onion", "quantity": 60, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "garlic", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "coriander", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Prepare the dry beans separately. Dice the raw peeled sweet potato and simmer with onion, garlic, tomatoes and measured oil, adding water as needed.", "es": "Prepara aparte las alubias secas. Corta el boniato crudo pelado y cuécelo con la cebolla, el ajo, el tomate y el aceite medido, añadiendo agua si hace falta."}, {"en": "When the sweet potato is tender, add the cooked beans, heat through and finish with coriander.", "es": "Cuando el boniato esté tierno, añade las alubias cocidas, calienta bien y termina con cilantro."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 491.53, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "491.53", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["blackeye_bean", "sweet_potato"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Apple and yogurt", "es": "Manzana con yogur"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "apple", "quantity": 120, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "quantity": 80, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Wash and core the apple, weigh and chop; serve with the measured yogurt.", "es": "Lava la manzana y retira el corazón; pesa y corta la parte comestible y sirve con el yogur medido."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 106.8, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "106.8", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 491.53, "with_optional_dessert": 598.33}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "491.53", "with_optional_dessert": "598.33"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "beans_blackeye", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_legume", "soak_minutes": 720, "additional_cook_minutes_range": [60, 120], "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then soak at least 12 hours. Discard soaking water, rinse, and use plenty of fresh water. Boil vigorously for at least 10 minutes, then continue cooking until fully tender, following the packet if it requires longer. Never cook raw kidney beans only in a slow cooker. The dry weight, not the hydrated weight, is the calorie reference.", "es": "Pesa en seco y remoja al menos 12 horas. Desecha el agua de remojo, enjuaga y usa abundante agua nueva. Hierve enérgicamente al menos 10 minutos y continúa la cocción hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase si exige más tiempo. Nunca cocines alubias rojas crudas solo en una olla de cocción lenta. La referencia calórica es el peso seco, no el hidratado."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m34','{"id": "m34", "name": {"en": "Creamy pea and spinach pasta", "es": "Pasta cremosa con guisantes y espinacas"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 15, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Creamy pea and spinach pasta", "es": "Pasta cremosa con guisantes y espinacas"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "peas", "quantity": 160, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "spinach", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "garlic", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "basil", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook pasta and frozen peas separately. Warm measured oil with garlic and wilt the spinach.", "es": "Cuece la pasta y los guisantes congelados por separado. Calienta el aceite medido con el ajo y rehoga las espinacas."}, {"en": "Take the pan off the heat and mix in yogurt, cooked peas and pasta, loosening with a little cooking water. Add basil; do not boil the yogurt sauce.", "es": "Retira la sartén del fuego y mezcla el yogur, los guisantes cocidos y la pasta, aligerando con un poco de agua de cocción. Añade albahaca; no hiervas la salsa de yogur."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 230.89, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "230.89", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"], "variety_keys": ["pea"]}, {"id": "side", "kind": "side", "name": {"en": "Grain accompaniment", "es": "Guarnición de cereal"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "pasta_wholewheat", "quantity": 70, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the weighed dry grain using its preparation instructions; serve with the main dish.", "es": "Cocina el cereal pesado en seco siguiendo sus instrucciones de preparación y sírvelo con el plato principal."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 230.3, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "230.3", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["pasta"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Orange and almonds", "es": "Naranja con almendras"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "orange", "quantity": 150, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "almond", "quantity": 10, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Peel the orange, weigh its flesh and serve with the measured almonds.", "es": "Pela la naranja, pesa la pulpa y sirve con las almendras medidas."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 109.4, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "109.4", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 461.19, "with_optional_dessert": 570.59}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "461.19", "with_optional_dessert": "570.59"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "pasta_wholewheat", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_grain", "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then cook with water according to the packet until tender; rinse quinoa first. Drain only if the packet method requires it. Count the original dry quantity for calories. Serve rice promptly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es": "Pesa en seco y cocina con agua según el envase hasta que esté tierno; lava antes la quinoa. Escurre solo si el método del envase lo requiere. Usa la cantidad seca inicial para calcular las calorías. Sirve el arroz enseguida; enfría las sobras rápidamente, idealmente en una hora, refrigera, consume en 24 horas y recalienta una sola vez."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m35','{"id": "m35", "name": {"en": "Mushroom and chickpea stuffed peppers", "es": "Pimientos rellenos de champiñones y garbanzos"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 40, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Mushroom and chickpea stuffed peppers", "es": "Pimientos rellenos de champiñones y garbanzos"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "pepper_red", "quantity": 200, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "chickpeas", "quantity": 50, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "mushroom", "quantity": 120, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "couscous", "quantity": 40, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}, {"ingredient_id": "tomato_canned", "quantity": 150, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "parsley", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Prepare dry chickpeas and couscous separately. Halve and deseed the peppers; soften them at 200°C for 15 minutes.", "es": "Prepara por separado los garbanzos secos y el cuscús. Parte los pimientos y retira las semillas; ablanda en el horno a 200 °C durante 15 minutos."}, {"en": "Cook mushrooms in measured oil, then combine with cooked chickpeas, couscous, tomatoes and parsley. Fill peppers and bake until tender and hot throughout.", "es": "Cocina los champiñones con el aceite medido y mezcla con los garbanzos cocidos, el cuscús, el tomate y el perejil. Rellena los pimientos y hornea hasta que estén tiernos y bien calientes."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 430.47, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "430.47", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["chickpea", "couscous", "pepper"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Warm pear with ginger", "es": "Pera templada con jengibre"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "pear", "quantity": 150, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "ginger", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Wash and core the pear, weigh and dice; warm with the ginger and a little water until tender.", "es": "Lava la pera, retira el corazón, pesa y corta; calienta con el jengibre y un poco de agua hasta que esté tierna."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 64.94, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "64.94", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 430.47, "with_optional_dessert": 495.41}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "430.47", "with_optional_dessert": "495.41"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "chickpeas", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_legume", "soak_minutes": 720, "additional_cook_minutes_range": [60, 120], "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then soak at least 12 hours. Discard soaking water, rinse, and use plenty of fresh water. Boil vigorously for at least 10 minutes, then continue cooking until fully tender, following the packet if it requires longer. Never cook raw kidney beans only in a slow cooker. The dry weight, not the hydrated weight, is the calorie reference.", "es": "Pesa en seco y remoja al menos 12 horas. Desecha el agua de remojo, enjuaga y usa abundante agua nueva. Hierve enérgicamente al menos 10 minutos y continúa la cocción hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase si exige más tiempo. Nunca cocines alubias rojas crudas solo en una olla de cocción lenta. La referencia calórica es el peso seco, no el hidratado."}}, {"ingredient_id": "couscous", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_grain", "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry, then cook with water according to the packet until tender; rinse quinoa first. Drain only if the packet method requires it. Count the original dry quantity for calories. Serve rice promptly; cool leftovers quickly, ideally within one hour, refrigerate, use within 24 hours and reheat only once.", "es": "Pesa en seco y cocina con agua según el envase hasta que esté tierno; lava antes la quinoa. Escurre solo si el método del envase lo requiere. Usa la cantidad seca inicial para calcular las calorías. Sirve el arroz enseguida; enfría las sobras rápidamente, idealmente en una hora, refrigera, consume en 24 horas y recalienta una sola vez."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": []}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','recipe','m36','{"id": "m36", "name": {"en": "Lentil and courgette potato pie", "es": "Pastel de lentejas, calabacín y patata"}, "meal_types": ["lunch", "dinner"], "reference_servings": 1, "active_prep_minutes": 10, "finishing_cook_minutes": 45, "components": [{"id": "main", "kind": "main", "name": {"en": "Lentil and courgette potato pie", "es": "Pastel de lentejas, calabacín y patata"}, "optional": false, "default_included": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "lentils_green", "quantity": 70, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "main"}, {"ingredient_id": "potato", "quantity": 220, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "base"}, {"ingredient_id": "courgette", "quantity": 120, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "carrot", "quantity": 80, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "tomato_canned", "quantity": 150, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "onion", "quantity": 50, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "olive_oil", "quantity": 5, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "basil", "quantity": 3, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "salt", "quantity": 1, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Cook the weighed lentils. Boil the weighed raw potato and mash it with a little cooking water, without unlisted butter or milk.", "es": "Cuece las lentejas pesadas. Hierve la patata pesada en crudo y cháfala con un poco de agua de cocción, sin añadir mantequilla ni leche que no estén indicadas."}, {"en": "Soften onion, carrot and courgette in measured oil. Add tomatoes, cooked lentils and basil; simmer until tender.", "es": "Rehoga la cebolla, la zanahoria y el calabacín con el aceite medido. Añade tomate, lentejas cocidas y albahaca; cuece hasta que estén tiernos."}, {"en": "Put the filling in an oven dish, top with mash and bake at 200°C until bubbling and lightly coloured.", "es": "Coloca el relleno en una fuente, cubre con el puré y hornea a 200 °C hasta que burbujee y se dore ligeramente."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 526.85, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "526.85", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "variety_keys": ["lentil", "potato"]}, {"id": "dessert", "kind": "dessert", "name": {"en": "Berry yogurt", "es": "Yogur con frutos rojos"}, "optional": true, "default_included": false, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "strawberry", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "blueberry", "quantity": 50, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}, {"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "quantity": 80, "unit": "g", "variety_role": "support"}], "instructions": [{"en": "Wash and weigh the berries, slice if needed and serve with the yogurt.", "es": "Lava y pesa los frutos rojos, córtalos si hace falta y sirve con el yogur."}], "reference_energy_kcal": 95.6, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": "95.6", "dietary_patterns": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"], "variety_keys": []}], "provenance": {"kind": "original_repository_content", "copied_recipe_text": false}, "review_status": "desk_validated_not_kitchen_tested", "reference_energy_kcal": {"without_optional_dessert": 526.85, "with_optional_dessert": 622.45}, "reference_energy_kcal_exact": {"without_optional_dessert": "526.85", "with_optional_dessert": "622.45"}, "dietary_patterns": {"without_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian", "vegan"], "with_optional_dessert": ["omnivore", "pescatarian", "vegetarian"]}, "ingredient_preparation": [{"ingredient_id": "lentils_green", "mode": "separate_before_finishing", "kind": "dry_lentil", "soak_minutes": 0, "additional_cook_minutes_range": [20, 40], "instructions": {"en": "Weigh dry and rinse. Cook in plenty of water until fully tender, following the packet; red split lentils usually soften sooner than whole lentils. No cooked-weight conversion is assumed.", "es": "Pesa en seco y enjuaga. Cuece en abundante agua hasta que estén completamente tiernas, siguiendo el envase; las lentejas rojas partidas suelen ablandarse antes que las enteras. No se presupone ninguna conversión de peso cocido."}}], "dietary_label_checks": {"without_optional_dessert": [], "with_optional_dessert": [{"ingredient_id": "yogurt", "for_patterns": ["vegetarian"], "status": "requires_actual_product_label_confirmation", "requirement": {"en": "Choose a source-matching product whose label confirms the selected dietary pattern; generic nutrition data do not certify every brand.", "es": "Elige un producto que corresponda a la referencia y cuya etiqueta confirme el patrón alimentario elegido; los datos genéricos no certifican todas las marcas."}}]}, "finishing_times_exclude_soaking_and_prerequisite_cooking": true, "safety_note_ids": ["weigh_and_prepare"]}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s01','{"id": "s01", "from_ingredient_id": "chicken", "to_ingredient_id": "turkey", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m17", "m18", "m27"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Use boneless skinless turkey light meat; cook to the listed safe poultry temperature.", "es": "Usa carne blanca de pavo sin piel ni hueso y cocina hasta la temperatura segura indicada para aves."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s02','{"id": "s02", "from_ingredient_id": "turkey", "to_ingredient_id": "chicken", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m16", "m26"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Use chicken light meat, finely minced for meatballs; cook to the safe poultry temperature.", "es": "Usa carne blanca de pollo, picada finamente para las albóndigas; cocina hasta la temperatura segura para aves."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s03','{"id": "s03", "from_ingredient_id": "chicken", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.3, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m18", "m27"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Omit the raw-chicken frying step. Cook vegetables first, then gently fold in source-matching plain steamed tofu and heat through. Review texture and portion size.", "es": "Omite el paso de freír pollo crudo. Cocina primero las verduras y añade con cuidado tofu natural al vapor que corresponda a la referencia; calienta bien y revisa textura y ración."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s04','{"id": "s04", "from_ingredient_id": "turkey", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.3, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m26"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Cook the carrot first; gently warm source-matching steamed tofu with the spinach instead of frying raw turkey.", "es": "Cocina primero la zanahoria; calienta con cuidado tofu al vapor que corresponda a la referencia con las espinacas, en lugar de freír pavo crudo."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s05','{"id": "s05", "from_ingredient_id": "pork", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.3, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m19", "m28"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Cook fruit/vegetables first. Add plain steamed tofu near the end, gently; do not apply the raw-pork searing step.", "es": "Cocina primero la fruta y las verduras. Añade con cuidado tofu natural al vapor al final; no apliques el paso de dorar cerdo crudo."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s06','{"id": "s06", "from_ingredient_id": "salmon", "to_ingredient_id": "cod", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m20", "m29"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Use boneless cod; adjust cooking time to thickness and check the safe core temperature. This is not an equal-calorie swap.", "es": "Usa bacalao sin espinas; adapta el tiempo al grosor y comprueba la temperatura interior segura. El cambio no aporta las mismas calorías."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s07','{"id": "s07", "from_ingredient_id": "cod", "to_ingredient_id": "salmon", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m21", "m30"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Use boneless salmon and cook through; recalculate the higher-fat ingredient''s calories before portion review.", "es": "Usa salmón sin espinas y cocina completamente; recalcula las calorías de este ingrediente más graso antes de revisar la ración."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s08','{"id": "s08", "from_ingredient_id": "cod", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.2, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m21", "m30"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Cook the sauce/vegetables first, then add plain steamed tofu gently and heat through; do not treat tofu as raw fish.", "es": "Cocina primero la salsa o las verduras y añade con cuidado tofu natural al vapor; calienta bien y no trates el tofu como pescado crudo."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s09','{"id": "s09", "from_ingredient_id": "salmon", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.2, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m20", "m29"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Cook the accompaniments first and gently heat plain steamed tofu separately; replace the fish-baking step.", "es": "Cocina primero las guarniciones y calienta con cuidado tofu natural al vapor aparte; sustituye el paso de hornear el pescado."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s10','{"id": "s10", "from_ingredient_id": "prawns", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.2, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m22"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Warm plain steamed tofu gently with the cooked rice/peas instead of frying raw prawns.", "es": "Calienta con cuidado tofu natural al vapor con el arroz y los guisantes cocidos en lugar de freír langostinos crudos."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s11','{"id": "s11", "from_ingredient_id": "beef", "to_ingredient_id": "lentils_green", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 0.45, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m15", "m25"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "The replacement quantity is DRY lentils. Cook them separately until tender, then fold into the finished vegetable sauce; omit raw-mince browning.", "es": "La cantidad de sustitución es de lentejas SECAS. Cuécelas aparte hasta que estén tiernas e incorpóralas a la salsa de verduras terminada; omite el dorado de carne cruda."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s12','{"id": "s12", "from_ingredient_id": "tuna", "to_ingredient_id": "chickpeas", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 0.5, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m23"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "The quantity is DRY chickpeas. Complete soaking and boiling first, then use the cooked chickpeas in place of drained tuna.", "es": "La cantidad es de garbanzos SECOS. Completa primero el remojo y la cocción y usa los garbanzos cocidos en lugar del atún escurrido."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s13','{"id": "s13", "from_ingredient_id": "sardines", "to_ingredient_id": "chickpeas", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 0.5, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m24"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Prepare the dry chickpeas fully, mash with the listed lemon, then use as a toast topping instead of sardines. This does not preserve fish nutrients.", "es": "Prepara completamente los garbanzos secos, machaca con el limón indicado y úsalos sobre la tostada en lugar de sardinas. No conserva los nutrientes del pescado."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s14','{"id": "s14", "from_ingredient_id": "milk", "to_ingredient_id": "soy_milk", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["b01", "b03", "b09"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Replace by weighed grams, not an assumed equal volume. The soy drink must match the unsweetened fortified source entry.", "es": "Sustituye por gramos pesados, sin presuponer un volumen igual. La bebida de soja debe corresponder a la referencia enriquecida y sin azúcar."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s15','{"id": "s15", "from_ingredient_id": "egg", "to_ingredient_id": "tofu", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1.5, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["b07", "b08"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Make a tofu scramble, not a set omelette: cook vegetables first, fold in crumbled plain steamed tofu and heat through.", "es": "Prepara un revuelto de tofu, no una tortilla cuajada: cocina primero las verduras, añade tofu natural al vapor desmenuzado y calienta bien."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s16','{"id": "s16", "from_ingredient_id": "rice_white", "to_ingredient_id": "rice_brown", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m02", "m09", "m18", "m22"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Swap dry weights and follow the brown-rice packet''s longer cooking time.", "es": "Sustituye los pesos en seco y sigue el mayor tiempo de cocción indicado en el envase del arroz integral."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s17','{"id": "s17", "from_ingredient_id": "pasta", "to_ingredient_id": "pasta_wholewheat", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["m16", "m23"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Swap dry weights and follow the replacement packet''s cooking instructions.", "es": "Sustituye los pesos en seco y sigue las instrucciones de cocción del envase de la pasta elegida."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s18','{"id": "s18", "from_ingredient_id": "peanut_butter", "to_ingredient_id": "almond", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["b02"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Use finely chopped almonds as a topping rather than a spread; this is not a nut-free alternative.", "es": "Usa almendras picadas como cobertura en lugar de una crema; no es una alternativa sin frutos de cáscara."}}'::jsonb);
insert into app_private.starter_content values('2026-11','substitution','s19','{"id": "s19", "from_ingredient_id": "walnut", "to_ingredient_id": "pumpkin_seed", "initial_target_grams_per_source_gram": 1, "ratio_basis": "editorial_starting_amount_not_nutritional_equivalence", "allowed_recipe_ids": ["b01", "b04"], "requires_review": true, "recalculate_calories_and_portions": true, "instruction_override": {"en": "Replace the topping by weighed grams and review exclusions for the replacement ingredient.", "es": "Sustituye la cobertura por gramos pesados y revisa las exclusiones del ingrediente alternativo."}}'::jsonb);
